{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/glossary/layout,_N_T_/glossary/page,_N_T_/glossary"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/glossary/__PAGE__","/glossary","/_index","/_head"]},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--DHHyHh_Ff3S5PG3AajNLG--><html lang=\"en-US\" class=\"dark\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/797e433ab948586e-s.p.29207c2f.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/caa3a2e1cccd8315-s.p.3b6cae6d.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/34d933785a17edf3.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/bfd6eb476abf7f9c.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/dec11ab5b071f102.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/f091501564eb2ea3.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/771dedee3f5e1621.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/170d65956da23aac.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-585fb9a968b38771.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/49e33bee669819de.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/868a9c4503c53c54.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/d791dd6e73034ab4.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/c322938c6693d41b.js\" async=\"\"></script><script async=\"\" data-cfasync=\"false\" src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-9SEBTKFT61\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/61cc43b3d7ad2990.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/5552623386487b15.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4fe21e8ee7b1235c.js\" async=\"\"></script><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\"/><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"/><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com\"/><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://www.google-analytics.com\"/><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://analytics.ahrefs.com\"/><link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\"/><link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\"/><link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com\"/><link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://www.google-analytics.com\"/><link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://analytics.ahrefs.com\"/><link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://www.irs.gov\"/><link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://taxfoundation.org\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.json\"/><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#0a0f1e\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>Tax Glossary — 2026 Tax Terms Explained | TheTaxCalc</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Tax glossary with 25+ terms explained for 2026. FICA, standard deduction, marginal rate, AGI, capital gains brackets, and more. Free, accurate definitions.\"/><meta name=\"author\" content=\"Rachel Mitchell, CPA\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"what is FICA,what is standard deduction,what is marginal tax rate,tax glossary,tax terms explained,what is AGI,adjusted gross income,tax bracket definition,effective tax rate,self-employment tax,capital gains tax brackets,tax credit vs tax deduction,what is FICA tax,additional medicare tax,HSA vs FSA,progressive tax,withholding tax definition,taxable income definition,estate tax exemption 2026,state income tax rates,payroll tax explained,2026 tax terms\"/><meta name=\"creator\" content=\"TheTaxCalc\"/><meta name=\"publisher\" content=\"TheTaxCalc\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><meta name=\"googlebot\" content=\"index, follow, max-video-preview:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1\"/><meta name=\"category\" content=\"finance\"/><meta name=\"classification\" content=\"Tax Calculator\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://thetaxcalc.com/glossary\"/><meta name=\"google-site-verification\" content=\"verify_google_site_verification_token\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tax Glossary — 2026 Tax Terms Explained\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Tax glossary with 25+ terms explained for 2026. FICA, standard deduction, marginal rate, AGI, capital gains brackets, and more. Free, accurate definitions.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://thetaxcalc.com/glossary\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"TheTaxCalc\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://thetaxcalc.com/opengraph-image.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"Tax Glossary 2026 — TheTaxCalc\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Tax Glossary — 2026 Tax Terms Explained\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"25+ tax terms explained for 2026: FICA, standard deduction, marginal rate, AGI, and more.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://thetaxcalc.com/opengraph-image.png\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:alt\" content=\"Tax Glossary 2026 — TheTaxCalc\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\"/><script data-cfasync=\"false\">(function(w,d,s,l,i){w[l]=w[l]||[];w[l].push({'gtm.start':\nnew Date().getTime(),event:'gtm.js'});var f=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],\nj=d.createElement(s),dl=l!='dataLayer'?'&l='+l:'';j.async=true;j.src=\n'https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtm.js?id='+i+dl;f.parentNode.insertBefore(j,f);\n})(window,document,'script','dataLayer','GTM-KWWRJFPZ');</script><script data-cfasync=\"false\">\n                  window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\n                  function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}\n                  gtag('js', new Date());\n                  gtag('config', 'G-9SEBTKFT61');\n                </script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/#organization\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"TheTaxCalc\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/icon.png\"},\"description\":\"Free 2026 tax calculators — paycheck, mortgage, 401(k), capital gains, and self-employment. Trusted by thousands of users for accurate, up-to-date tax estimates.\",\"foundingDate\":\"2022\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://thetaxcalc.com/about\",\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog\",\"https://thetaxcalc.com/research\",\"https://thetaxcalc.com/methodology\"],\"contactPoint\":[{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/about#contact\",\"contactType\":\"customer support\",\"availableLanguage\":[\"English\"]}]},{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/#website\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"name\":\"TheTaxCalc\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com\",\"description\":\"Free 2026 tax calculators — paycheck, mortgage, 401(k), capital gains, and self-employment.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/#organization\"},\"potentialAction\":{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/?q={search_term_string}\"},\"query-input\":\"required name=search_term_string\"}},{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/#webpage-home\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"name\":\"2026 Tax Calculator — Paycheck & Take-Home Pay | 50 States\",\"description\":\"Free 2026 tax calculator. Take-home pay after federal, FICA & state tax. 64 tools & 50-state sales tax data. No sign-up.\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/#website\"},\"about\":{\"@type\":\"Thing\",\"name\":\"Tax Calculator\"}}]}</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/a6dad97d9634a72d.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"geist_a71539c9-module__T19VSG__variable geist_mono_8d43a2aa-module__8Li5zG__variable antialiased bg-background text-foreground\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a href=\"#main-content\" class=\"sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:fixed focus:top-4 focus:left-4 focus:z-[9999] focus:rounded-lg focus:bg-emerald-600 focus:px-4 focus:py-2 focus:text-white focus:shadow-lg\">Skip to main content</a><noscript><iframe src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/ns.html?id=GTM-KWWRJFPZ\" height=\"0\" width=\"0\" style=\"display:none;visibility:hidden\"></iframe></noscript><div class=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-background bg-mesh\"><a href=\"#main-content\" class=\"sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:fixed focus:top-4 focus:left-4 focus:z-[100] focus:rounded-lg focus:bg-emerald-600 focus:px-4 focus:py-2 focus:text-white focus:shadow-lg\">Skip to main content</a><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-[100] w-full glass-strong overflow-visible\"><div class=\"h-[2px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-emerald-500/60 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"mx-auto flex h-16 max-w-7xl items-center justify-between px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 overflow-visible\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 transition-all hover:opacity-90 group\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"relative flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500 to-emerald-600 shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/20 group-hover:shadow-emerald-500/30 transition-shadow\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2